Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Sarah
Your session covariates are missing for 4 sessions, so predict() fails with the default 'newdata'. (predict.secr is called by the print method for secr objects). You can either replace the NA values in 'covs' or explicitly drop those lines: predict(tmpcov2, newdata=covs[-c(17,18,35,36),])
Murray

