So the function does not run, but when I do the models one by one, e.g.

model2 =secr.fit(all_years, group = "sex", model = list(g0 ~ g), CL = FALSE)

Then it is all fine.

I have made the capthist with:

all_years = read.capthist('all_195a.csv',
                          'detectors.csv', detector = "multi", fmt = "trapID", covnames = c("sex"))

Any ideas?

Thanks for your help!

